Z||000007||mshill||12-02-2001||01:45 AM||||I saw this today as well.  It is interesting at best.  To call it a Testorossa replica is quite a stretch.  The three things I didn't like in particular were 1) the front of the doors looked very strange, 2) I don't think the black (where the strakes are supposed to be) looks good at all, and 3)  the notchback sail panels that really say "Fiero".<P>I personally don't like it, and if it was mine I certainly wouldn't have little yellow Ferrari badges on it.  Someone thought it was cool, cause they built it.||||reg||1
